      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s first major industry began in 1895 with the construction of the Plum Valley Creamery and a butter‑maker’s house a block north.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://cityofwaldorf.com/history/",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1907 the Alphabet Railroad ran through Waldorf, passing a block south of the original Plum Valley site.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
